  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/z7IePjw.png\" alt=\"橫幅\" width=\"2990\" height=\"1734\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Glass 為所有玻璃方塊（包括普通玻璃、染色玻璃、遮光玻璃以及對應的玻璃片）添加了連接紋理。</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oiLDPwT.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1080\" height=\"180\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Fusion Connected Glass 需要 <img style=\"width:1em\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/835/860/638227854854712053.png\" alt=\"Fusion 標誌\"> Fusion 才能正常運作。您可以點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方圖片找到 Fusion。</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CelestialAbyss/badges/refs/heads/main/fusion/requires/compact_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Fusion\" width=\"364\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EIB3ap6.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1080\" height=\"180\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">如需了解未來內容、即將推出的模組或進行討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"加入 SuperMartijn642 的模組 Discord 伺服器\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/orIjSR2.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1080\" height=\"180\"></p>",
